abstract: "Code and locked data for the preregistered causal battery showing that the observational link between representational dimensionality and OOD transfer (r = +0.97) does not license geometry-as-a-knob interventions: the geometric causal share of the slope is 7.7%, formation-phase whitening benefits are probe-conditioning effects, and every covariance-spectrum marker is a recipe fingerprint. v1.1.0 absorbs the E5e direct tests of the saturation and headroom conjectures (55-check self-verification)."
